  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You will now identify high-level opportunities. This will be based on data gathered in the previous stages, which may be achieved with or without creating a new contract.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Strategic sourcing highlights opportunities in three key areas:",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Purchase Demand Management;",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Supply Base Management;",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Total Cost Management;",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The above are portrayed as the three sides of the 'Best Value Triangle', which can be found at the bottom of the page.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your commodity/service team should assess and highlight the potential opportunities on the triangle that could be further developed. The team should determine how they could be applied to the commodity/service in question. Risk should always be considered.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your assessment of high-level opportunities should be carried out using the Sustainable Procurement Test, which can be found on the Sustainable Procurement Tools Platform.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Best Value Triangle, available in both in graphic and table format, can be found at the bottom of the page.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You must also include any economic, social and enviro nmental, and sustainable procurement opportunities in your strategy e.g. include community benefits and Fair Work Practices.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This exercise should be proportionate to the complexity of your requirement. You are not expected to address eve ry aspect of the best value triangl e.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Are There Early Opportunities?",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Early opportunities are defined as cost savings, sustainable procurement opportunities or total cost improvements which:",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Can be implemented within 90 days;",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Provide benefits within six to twelve months;",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Have been considered as part of the Scottish Sustainable Procurement Prioritisation methodology;",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are relatively easy and straightforward to do;",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are often tactical and short-term in nature;",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Must support strategic plans.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Opportunity Assessment",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There are many factors to consider for implementation of all opportunities as well as early opportunities:",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Timescales/implementation time;",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Complexity and how many other functions need to be involved;",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Number of geographical locations/business units involved;",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Specification changes required e.g. regulatory, safety, criticality, legal;",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Use of external technology;",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Acceptability to the customer;",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Business Unit readiness - 'pull';",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Supply market challenge;",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Skills & knowledge (existing and what is required for the future);",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Number of people involved in mobilisation;",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Clear decision ow ner(s);",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Results of the risk assessment.",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "T he Opportunity Assessment Template is an aid to quantifying and prioritising the opportunities which will be included in the commodity strategy.",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Are There Early Opportunities?",
        "Opportunity Assessment"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
